Overview of changes in version 0.5.05:

  - Fixed positionating the joker in colour series (again)
  - Fixed/improved playing of jokers
  - Improved navigation in help files
  - Prohibiting resorting of cards after picking up pile (til pile is put down)
  - Fixed check if player has fitting pair (without joker) when picking up pile
  - Fixed translations of the game

Overview of changes in version 0.5.04:

  - Loading the cardimages in the main thread (no extra thread)
  - Fixed applying new cardimages closing the selection dialog
  - Fixed and enhanced test for KDE carddecks
  - Fixed positionating the joker in colour series
  - After picking up dumped pile only allow to play the cards already in hand
  - Fixed making first "cerrado" with last cards - hopefully; hard to test ;)
  - Fixed computer player not playing pile of 7 joker in some cases

Overview of changes in version 0.5.03:

  - Displaying the cards of all Buraco players
  - Fixed bug where the fitting last two cards in hand can't make a cerrado
  - Fixed bug analyzing the validity of colour piles (for the human player)
  - Fixed bug replacing a joker in a coloured pile
  - Fixed jokers not playing on joker-pile (in some cases)
  - Fixed computer player taking up dumped pile with joker
  - Needs libYGP 0.6.30

Overview of changes in version 0.5.02:

  - Fixed bug in replacing the joker in colour series
  - Fixed warning message about not installed libpthread, though it is installed
  - Updated INSTALL (installation from CVS)
  - Updated version info in po files (which hold the translated messages)

Overview of changes in version 0.5.01:

  - Changed manual sorting of cards in hand of human players in Buraco
  - Searching for the best pile to play cards to

Overview of changes in version 0.5.00:

  - Added network ability
  - Improved Buraco's layout (table shows scrollbars, when needed)
  - Improved Buracos computer player
  - Twopart, Røvhult and Buraco starts with a random player
  - Fixed Røvhult's checking of humans playing from pile
  - Fixed Twopart's calcuation of next player (equal cards at end of part I)
  - Fixed Buraco's computer player taking dumped pile with series of colour
  - Renamed [Players]-section in INI-file to [Player]
  - Needs library YGP 0.6.21

Overview of changes in version 0.4.00:

  - New game: Buraco
  - Switched to GCC 3
  - Using GTKMM2/GTK+ 2
  - Needs library YGP 0.6.20
  - Cards aint influenced by GTK-styles (as they are only images, not buttons)
  - Providing an icon for the window managers
  - Cards must now be in png-format (which allows to use KDE's cards directly)
  - Fixed bug in Hearts (Human could play any club in round 1)

Overview of changes in version 0.3.02:

  - Using XAttributeLabel2 in HeartsScore dialog
  - Hearts ends now at 100 points (and not 101)
  - Fixed bug in Hearts (played Queen of spades in round 1)

Overview of changes in version 0.3.01:

